Any design work in this repo (websites, banners, social, wireframes, brand kits, Figma edits, pitch) is TasteSkill work. Load `.cursor/skills/anti-slop/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/image-models/SKILL.md` before generating pixels.

The Cloud Agent chat model is not the art engine. When you need imagery, call a specialist:

- Mood / style consistency → Midjourney
- Precise edits, “keep this change that” → GPT Image 2 (`gpt-image-2`)
- Photorealism and natural lighting → Nano Banana 2 (`gemini-3.1-flash-image`)
- Controlled realism, open weights → FLUX.2 (`flux-2-pro`)
- Crisp type inside the image → Ideogram 4.0 / 3.0
- Fine-tune / local / LoRA → Stable Diffusion 3.5
- Blend into an existing photo, Creative Cloud → Adobe Firefly 5

Honor the image plan on an Atelier packet. POST `/api/image` — one OpenRouter key calls the specialist (or its documented stand-in). Set website UI type in the Next app. Set banner/social type-in-image with Ideogram. Empty gray photo slots are a defect.
